{"id":"2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create","date":"2026-11-16","topic":"ai","region":"americas","headline":"Smart Software Helps Create Visual Signals in the Brain","source":{"name":"ScienceDaily","url":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/11/261110042553.htm"},"accent":"ca","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Scientists create a computer tool to help people see.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.78,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.99,"times":[0.0,0.54,1.08,1.44,1.76,2.24,2.58,2.8,3.18]},{"text":"Michael Beyeler from UC Santa Barbara leads this project.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","M","M","M","V","O","O"],"dur":3.64,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":5.54,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.76,1.04,1.24,1.76,2.2,2.6,2.9]},{"text":"In 2024, his team works in Spain.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t1-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","M","M"],"dur":2.75,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.0,"times":[0.0,0.06,1.14,1.32,1.6,1.92,2.2]},{"text":"A 27-year-old man cannot see any light.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","O","O"],"dur":3.05,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.91,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.96,1.24,1.54,2.08,2.46]},{"text":"The new computer tool helps him see light spots.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","C","C","C"],"dur":3.29,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.17,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.24,0.56,1.02,1.4,1.64,1.86,2.18]}],"bands":{"core1000":86,"core1800":11,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"to help people see.","title":"Infinitive of Purpose","note":"This phrase explains why the scientists created the tool. Using 'to' followed by a base verb shows the goal of an action."},{"i":3,"focus":"cannot see","title":"Modal Verb for Ability","note":"'Cannot' shows that the man is unable to perform an action. It pairs with the base verb 'see' to describe physical ability."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Scientists used a new computer program to help a man see.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.12,"times":[0.0,0.56,1.06,1.38,1.6,1.96,2.54,2.86,3.06,3.22,3.46]},{"text":"In 2022, Michael Beyeler received money for five years of study.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t2-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.29,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":6.09,"times":[0.0,0.08,1.18,1.46,2.0,2.28,2.62,2.86,3.16,3.56,3.8]},{"text":"In 2024, his team tested the device at Hospital IMED Elche in Spain.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t2-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.27,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":7.36,"times":[0.0,0.08,1.2,1.44,1.72,2.08,2.3,2.52,2.86,3.32,3.96,4.4,4.7]},{"text":"A 27-year-old man tested 96 small points in his head for six months.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.64,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":6.72,"times":[0.0,0.13,0.88,1.14,1.46,2.0,2.58,2.92,3.16,3.28,3.54,3.76,4.0]},{"text":"The computer program predicted signals, so the man saw spots of light.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.0,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.89,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.84,1.2,2.28,2.36,2.48,2.68,2.98,3.18,3.5]},{"text":"This work will help researchers build better tools for people in the future.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":3.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":6.93,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.34,0.56,0.76,1.08,1.56,1.88,2.24,2.58,2.82,2.98,3.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":86,"core1800":11,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":4,"focus":"so","title":"Coordinating Conjunction for Result","note":"The word 'so' connects two independent clauses to express cause and effect. The first action directly leads to the outcome in the second clause."},{"i":5,"focus":"will help","title":"Future Tense with Will","note":"The auxiliary verb 'will' combines with 'help' to express a future expectation. It describes what the researchers expect this work to accomplish later."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Scientists have used smart computer models to help people who cannot see.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","S","V","V"],"dur":4.72,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":6.63,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.98,1.2,1.68,2.14,2.62,3.0,3.16,3.54,3.76,3.98]},{"text":"Michael Beyeler from UC Santa Barbara received two million dollars for five years of research.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","M","M","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.85,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.64,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.78,1.04,1.24,1.72,2.16,2.68,3.16,3.48,3.98,4.28,4.62,4.92,5.16]},{"text":"In 2024, his team traveled to Hospital IMED Elche in Spain to conduct tests.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t3-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.98,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":7.38,"times":[0.0,0.06,1.16,1.36,1.6,1.98,2.2,2.72,3.46,3.96,4.26,4.58,4.92,5.12]},{"text":"A 27-year-old man tried a small device with 96 tiny points in his brain.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.52,"times":[0.0,0.13,0.94,1.2,1.5,1.64,1.92,2.26,2.66,3.12,3.72,4.24,4.56,4.66]},{"text":"The device produced tiny sparks of light, which scientists call visual spots or phosphenes.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","S","V","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.74,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":8.28,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.24,0.6,1.08,1.48,1.78,2.42,2.5,2.94,3.34,3.68,4.14,4.74]},{"text":"A computer network studied brain patterns to find the best signals for the man.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.67,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.36,0.66,1.22,1.52,1.94,2.28,2.44,2.62,2.86,3.3,3.62,3.7]},{"text":"Their study appeared in Neuron and offers new hope for future sight technology.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.87,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":6.91,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.34,0.74,1.0,1.42,1.88,2.16,2.48,2.76,3.1,3.36,3.76]}],"bands":{"core1000":77,"core1800":14,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"have used","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect 'have used' connects past events to the present time. It shows that scientists began using smart computer models in the past and continue doing so today."},{"i":4,"focus":", which scientists call visual spots or phosphenes","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"This relative clause starts with 'which' to give extra context about the sparks of light. The comma before 'which' separates this supplementary detail from the main clause."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Computer scientists have used advanced software models to improve experimental devices that restore vision for people.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t4-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","M","M"],"dur":7.23,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":9.32,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.94,1.44,1.66,2.16,2.62,3.2,3.48,3.76,4.58,5.16,5.68,5.92,6.44,6.74]},{"text":"The five-year project was funded in 2022 by a two million dollar grant from the government.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.03,"times":[0.0,0.15,0.52,0.94,1.22,1.54,1.82,2.38,3.12,3.22,3.44,3.8,4.24,4.56,4.86,4.98]},{"text":"In 2024, researchers from UC Santa Barbara conducted clinical tests at Hospital IMED Elche in Spain.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","M","M","M","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.32,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":9.18,"times":[0.0,0.06,1.22,1.68,2.04,2.24,2.76,3.18,3.66,4.08,4.6,5.0,5.44,6.06,6.5,6.84]},{"text":"A 27-year-old participant tested an experimental implant with 96 tiny signal points in his visual system.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.08,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":7.62,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.96,1.52,1.96,2.26,2.96,3.28,3.8,4.3,4.96,5.42,5.82,6.08,6.2,6.52]},{"text":"Electric signals created light sensations called phosphenes, which appeared to the participant as bright spots or shapes.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.77,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.98,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.68,1.2,1.48,1.94,2.48,3.54,3.7,3.92,4.2,4.3,4.82,5.14,5.42,5.82,6.14]},{"text":"A deep computer network predicted how brain patterns would change when electrical signals were delivered.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","S","S","S","V","V","M","S","S","V","V"],"dur":5.37,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":6.83,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.26,0.66,1.14,1.62,2.02,2.34,2.76,3.04,3.36,3.72,4.06,4.48,4.82]},{"text":"Associate Professor Michael Beyeler reported that computer guidance reduced required electricity while creating clearer visual patterns.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","M","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.52,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":9.15,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.64,1.26,1.74,2.08,2.4,2.74,3.18,3.74,4.22,5.04,5.48,5.82,6.3,6.78]},{"text":"Their findings were published online in Neuron and show progress toward better medical tools for sight restoration.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t4-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.26,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":8.16,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.4,0.66,0.98,1.32,1.8,2.16,2.7,2.86,3.34,3.66,3.94,4.3,4.66,4.92,5.1]}],"bands":{"core1000":64,"core1800":20,"ngsl":7,"tsl":3,"nawl":1,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"was funded","title":"Passive Voice","note":"The passive voice 'was funded' highlights the project receiving financial support rather than focusing on the giver. It combines the past tense of 'be' with the past participle 'funded'."},{"i":5,"focus":"would change","title":"Future in the Past","note":"'Would change' expresses a future event as viewed from a past point in time. Because the main verb 'predicted' is in the past, 'will' shifts to 'would'."},{"i":6,"focus":"that computer guidance reduced required electricity","title":"Noun Clause as Object","note":"The conjunction 'that' introduces a noun clause that functions as the object of 'reported'. This clause contains its own subject and verb to detail the research outcome."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Researchers from three academic institutions have demonstrated how computer systems can significantly improve the accuracy of experimental visual implants.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t5-0.m4a","roles":["S","M","M","M","M","V","V","S","S","S","V","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":10.1,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.12,"times":[0.0,0.44,1.0,1.28,1.82,2.6,3.1,3.64,4.06,4.42,5.02,5.36,5.94,6.64,7.06,7.56,7.98,8.54,9.16]},{"text":"The effort was supported by a 2022 NIH Director's New Innovator Award, providing two million dollars across five years.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.35,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":9.78,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.62,1.0,1.3,1.4,2.14,2.78,3.68,3.98,4.64,5.34,5.66,6.06,6.4,6.9,7.28,7.68]},{"text":"In 2024, scientists from Michael Beyeler's Bionic Vision Lab at UC Santa Barbara traveled to Hospital IMED Elche in Spain.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.3,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":10.73,"times":[0.0,0.08,1.24,1.8,2.22,2.48,3.18,3.62,4.02,4.36,4.68,4.9,5.36,5.78,6.52,6.78,7.18,7.88,8.32,8.66]},{"text":"They worked with a 27-year-old participant who tested a temporary implant containing 96 electrodes placed in his visual cortex.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t5-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.17,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":8.57,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.52,0.67,1.58,1.94,2.64,2.94,3.2,3.6,4.14,4.64,5.3,6.12,6.56,6.9,7.02,7.38]},{"text":"When electric currents activated the device, the man perceived visual flashes known as phosphenes, appearing as spots or distinct light shapes.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.71,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":10.7,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.38,0.88,1.34,1.62,2.44,2.54,2.74,3.08,3.58,4.2,4.64,4.9,5.92,6.3,6.6,6.9,7.38,7.66,8.08]},{"text":"To make these visual responses predictable, the research team trained a deep neural network on the participant's resting brain patterns.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.24,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":9.28,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.2,0.4,0.74,1.34,2.5,2.56,2.84,3.2,3.54,3.76,4.02,4.32,4.88,5.14,5.24,5.88,6.06,6.52]},{"text":"The system successfully generated targeted brain activity while requiring substantially lower electrical currents than standard stimulation techniques.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t5-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.16,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":8.49,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.36,0.6,1.58,1.94,2.38,2.8,3.42,3.76,4.56,5.1,5.58,6.12,6.42,6.66,7.14]},{"text":"Published online in Neuron, the study highlights how personalizing brain stimulation could lead to effective future devices for vision loss.","voice":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/t5-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.1,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-16-ai-smart-software-helps-create/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":11.47,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.64,1.04,1.86,2.04,2.26,2.7,2.92,3.62,3.9,4.42,4.9,5.1,5.28,5.66,6.02,6.5,6.9,7.14]}],"bands":{"core1000":64,"core1800":14,"ngsl":9,"tsl":4,"nawl":1,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"providing two million dollars across five years","title":"Participle Phrase as Modifier","note":"The present participle 'providing' introduces a phrase that supplies background details about the grant. It functions as an adverbial modifier explaining the financial outcome."},{"i":4,"focus":"When electric currents activated the device","title":"Adverbial Time Clause","note":"The subordinating conjunction 'When' starts a clause specifying the timing of the main action. It contains its own subject ('electric currents') and verb ('activated')."},{"i":7,"focus":"Published online in Neuron","title":"Past Participle Introductory Modifier","note":"This past participle phrase modifies the main subject 'the study'. Placed at the front of the sentence, it offers concise background context about publication."}]}},"glossary":[{"word":"device","lemma":"device","pos":"noun","ipa":"/dɪˈvaɪ